        <p class="svetlina-method-meta" style="margin-top:4px;">
          Неизменяем архив в CERN Zenodo: <a href="https://zenodo.org/records/24580253" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="text-decoration:underline;font-weight:700;">DOI 10.5281/zenodo.24580253</a> · <a href="/en/" style="text-decoration:underline;">English Brief (EPPO / EC)</a>
        </p>
        <p class="svetlina-method-meta mono" style="word-break:break-all;margin-top:4px;">File SHA-256 (Zenodo &amp; live JSON): {RAW_FILE_SHA256}</p>
        {datasetSha256 ? <p class="svetlina-method-meta mono" style="word-break:break-all;margin-top:4px;">SHA-256 ({allRedFlagsList.length} RED snapshot): {datasetSha256}</p> : ''}
